IMPORT prelude
IMPORT daydate

-- Acts Interpretation Act 1954 (Qld), Part 9 -- Distance, time and age (ss 37 to 38A).
-- Section 37 is here.  The reckoning of time (s 38) and age (s 38A) are in qld-interpretation-time.l4.
-- The Justice and Other Legislation Amendment Act 2023, section 9 is not among the sources, so the day it commenced is an input.

§ `Part 9 -- Distance, time and age`

§§ `s 37 -- Measurement of distance`

-- (3): post-2023 provision means a provision enacted after the commencement of the Justice and Other Legislation Amendment Act 2023, section 9.
-- FORK a provision enacted on the day s 9 commenced: after (s 9 commences at the beginning of its day, s 15B, so an enactment later in that day is after it) || not after (same day)
-- src:820 | (3) In this section—
-- src:821 | post-2023 provision means a provision enacted after the commencement of the Justice and Other Legislation Amendment Act 2023, section 9.
@ref s 37(3), definition post-2023 provision (src:820-821)
GIVEN `the day the provision was enacted` IS A DATE
      `the day section 9 of the Justice and Other Legislation Amendment Act 2023 commenced` IS A DATE
GIVETH A MAYBE BOOLEAN
DECIDE `the provision is a post-2023 provision (s 37(3))` IS
    JUST (`the day the provision was enacted` AT LEAST `the day section 9 of the Justice and Other Legislation Amendment Act 2023 commenced`)

-- src:822 | pre-2023 provision means a provision other than a post-2023 provision.
-- src:823 | provision means a provision of an Act.
@ref s 37(3), definition pre-2023 provision (src:822-823)
GIVEN `it is a provision of an Act` IS A BOOLEAN
      `it is a post-2023 provision` IS A BOOLEAN
GIVETH A MAYBE BOOLEAN
DECIDE `the provision is a pre-2023 provision (s 37(3))` IS
    IF `it is a provision of an Act` THEN JUST (NOT `it is a post-2023 provision`) ELSE NOTHING

DECLARE `Contrary intention about the measurement of distance` IS ONE OF
    `no contrary intention`
    `a contrary intention that distance is to be measured in a straight line on a horizontal plane`
    `a contrary intention that distance is to be measured in another way`

DECLARE `Way of measuring distance` IS ONE OF
    `along the shortest road ordinarily used for travelling`
    `in a straight line on a horizontal plane`
    `in the other way the contrary intention requires`

-- src:818 | (1) In applying a pre-2023 provision, distance is to be measured along the shortest road ordinarily used for travelling unless there is a contrary intention that distance is to be measured in a straight line on a horizontal plane or in another way.
@ref s 37(1) (src:818-818)
-- src:819 | (2) In applying a post-2023 provision, distance is to be measured in a straight line on a horizontal plane.
@ref s 37(2) (src:819-819)
GIVEN `the provision is a post-2023 provision` IS A BOOLEAN
      intention IS A `Contrary intention about the measurement of distance`
GIVETH A `Way of measuring distance`
DECIDE `how distance is measured in applying the provision (s 37(1) and (2))` IS
    IF `the provision is a post-2023 provision`
    THEN `in a straight line on a horizontal plane`
    ELSE CONSIDER intention
        WHEN `no contrary intention` THEN `along the shortest road ordinarily used for travelling`
        WHEN `a contrary intention that distance is to be measured in a straight line on a horizontal plane` THEN `in a straight line on a horizontal plane`
        WHEN `a contrary intention that distance is to be measured in another way` THEN `in the other way the contrary intention requires`
